config BR2_PACKAGE_TCC
	bool "tcc"
	help
	  Tiny C Compiler — a small, fast C compiler that can compile
	  and run C code directly.  This builds a riscv32 cross from
	  the jrrk2/tinycc fork which has riscv32 target support.

	  Also installs musl C headers and CRT files so tcc can
	  compile and link programs on-target.

	  https://github.com/jrrk2/tinycc
